          "text": "The North Carolina Department of Revenue has tested and approved software designed by the vendors listed below for filing North Carolina Estates and Trusts Tax returns and payments through the Federal/State MeF Program for tax year 2020. Each software vendor must test and be granted approval for electronic filing each tax season. Each software product has different capabilities; therefore please check the product specifications to determine if it will meet your filing needs. Please continue to check the approved software developers list. This list will be updated, as additional software vendors are approved."
